WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.620
- So Charithra, social media has praised

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:04.490
casting darker skin, Indian actors.

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:06.680
So what has this meant for you?

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:10.080
- Colorism has existed at different times

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.650
throughout history.
- Yeah.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.950
- And I think it is particularly pervasive

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.370
in countries in Asia and in Africa

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.408
and South Asia and East Asia

00:00:19.408 --> 00:00:22.230
because of, well one, colonialism

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.300
and second to do with class and caste

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.220
and so, you know, it's
a daily struggle for us

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.830
'cause we're never allowed to forget it.

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:32.720
And it, I always say it
feels kind of violent to me

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:35.084
because it's comes from
within your own community.

00:00:35.084 --> 00:00:35.917
- Yeah.

00:00:35.917 --> 00:00:39.490
- And so I just hope that
Simone and I being in the show

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:43.450
can help dark skinned people of all races

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.050
to feel beautiful and to feel seen

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:47.720
and to feel worthy of love.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:48.870
- Yeah, absolutely.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.120
(audience cheering)

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.530
And it's also like one of my,

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:53.240
we love the artwork by the way

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.640
and when people dress up, we love it.

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.906
- Oh my God.
- And one of my favorite ones

00:00:56.906 --> 00:01:00.580
is of these two children who were dressed

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.500
up as the Duke and Lady Danbury.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.333
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:05.350
- And I'm like growing up, I didn't have,

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.380
I didn't know who to dress
up for Halloween parties.

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.050
- Exactly, yeah.
- I felt ridiculous

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:10.918
dressing up as Cinderella
or Sleeping Beauty.

00:01:10.918 --> 00:01:14.650
I was so scared people
would ask me who I was,

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:16.530
even though I obviously was Belle.

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:17.363
- Yeah.
- You know,

00:01:17.363 --> 00:01:22.050
and so for young girls to be
able to dress up as a dowager

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:23.700
- Yeah.
- and a duke and you know,

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:26.263
a princess and all of
these things is amazing.

